                                                "sense_id": "89aaf3b8-25c7-3fae-9042-49a809f6a122",
                                                "text": "He felt the stress and strain of life, its fevers and sweats and wild insurgences—surely this was the stuff to write about! He wanted to glorify the leaders of forlorn hopes, the mad lovers, the giants that fought under stress and strain, amid terror and tragedy, making life crackle with the strength of their endeavor."
